<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-12-07 21:10:16</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The shareholders of 00NATION AS (the Company) are hereby convened to an extraordinary general meeting on 14 December 2022 at 14:00 CET.<br><br>The meeting will be held electronically, and a URL to attend has been circulated via email to shareholders.<br><br>Please see the attached company presentation and EGM notice with agenda for the meeting.<br><br>For questions please contact:<br><br>Sebastian Geurts<br>CEO<br>sg@00nation.com<br><br>Stein Wilmann<br>COO<br>smw@00nation.com</p></td>
</tr>
