<td><h2>00NATION qualifies for the Counter-Strike Major in Rio de Janeiro</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-10-27 17:02:10</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>A major milestone in terms of sports performance which also secured the company's first Revenue from digital sales generated from a Counter-Strike-event.<br><br>The popular Brazilian team consisting of «Coldzera» and «Taco», both two times major winners and former MVPs of the global circuit return as fan favorites. Their careers have been revived under the 00 banner, well supported by some of the most promising, exciting and valuable talent in the industry, «Dumau», «Try» and «Latto». <br><br>Follow @zerozeronation and @zerozerobrasil on Twitter and Instagram for frequent updates.<br><br>For questions, please contact:<br><br>Stein Wilmann<br>Managing Director<br>smw@00nation.com<br>+47 46745484</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>00NATION secures new partnerships with Parimatch, Adidas, Ford, and Red Dragon</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-10-19 23:04:48</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>00NATION is steering toward all-time high revenues with the lionshare generated from long term commercial partnerships including new additions Parimatch, Adidas, Ford, and Red Dragon who will be joining existing partners DNB, Microsoft, Elgiganten, and Lenovo.<br> <br>The company has spent the last 18 months with a keen focus on developing commercial revenue streams to support its increasingly successful esports endeavors. Revenues for the first half year show significant growth:<br><br>Q1-2022: 6.15 MNOK, up from Q1-2021: 1.8 MNOK (+241% YoY)<br>Q2-2022: 7.62 MNOK, up from Q2-2022: 1.96 MNOK (+288% YoY)<br><br>A driving factor behind revenue growth has been a rise in commercial deal value, which are now peaking at 8.000.000 NOK annually, up from 5.000.000 NOK. <br><br>Follow @zerozeronation and @zerozerobrasil on Twitter and Instagram for frequent updates. <br><br>For questions, please contact:<br><br>Stein Wilmann<br>Managing Director<br>smw@00nation.com<br>+47 46745484</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
