<td><h2>00NATION SECURES FURTHER COMMITMENT FROM KEY COMMERCIAL PARTNERS</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-06-03 15:39:15</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>00NATION SECURES FURTHER COMMITMENT FOR KEY COMMERCIAL PARTNERS<br><br>Elkjøp doubles up partnership: "00 is a fantastic partner and we are looking forward to become contributors to the community" -Daniel Faldmo, Gaming Manager for Elkjøp.<br><br>DNB renews and substantially increases partnership with 00NATION: "00 understands youth culture" -Aina Lemoen-Lunde, Brand & Marketing Director for DNB.<br><br>For corresponding respective press releases, please see resources below.<br><br>For inquiries:<br><br>Steffen Willumsen<br>CCO | 00NATION<br>sw@00nation.com | +47 948 59 356</p></td>
