<td><h2>00NATION - Corporate update</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-03-01 11:35:32</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>00NATION is pleased to announce an update on Corporate developments following the business combination between Nordavind and 00 Nation in August, 2022.<br> <br>Highlights:<br> <br>-Secured NOK 24 million in annual revenues from 13 blue chip commercial partners.<br>-30 million total social media following across talents under management, with 200k followers on the Company’s Instagram and Twitter accounts.<br>-Refocused esport business with 4 teams in Counter-Strike, Rocket League, Fortnite and Street Fighter V with 2 additional academy teams in Counter-Strike and Rocket League respectively.<br>-42 talents under management, including new additions Coldzera, Dennis Hauger, Birk Ruud and Havanna Winter.<br>-Successfully launched first activation with Microsoft Xbox which included: campaign material, sound track and launch party.<br>-Successfully launched NFT business.<br> <br>For a complete overview, please see our attached investor update.<br> <br>For questions, please contact:<br><br>Stein Wilmann<br>COO<br>+47 46745484<br>smw@00nation.com<br><br>David Williams<br>Head of Business Affairs<br>+48 601203893<br>dw@00nation.com</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
