<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>OONATION (NVD) - COMPANY PRESENTATION – MARCH 1, 2022, 12:00 CET</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-02-17 09:14:27</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>00NATION is pleased to invite investors, analysts and media to a company presentation on Tuesday 1 March, 2022. The event will start at 12.00 CET and is expected to last approximately two hours, including Q&A.<br><br>The presentation will take place at Arctic Securities’ offices in Haakon VIIs gate 5. The meeting will also be held digitally through Microsoft Teams. <br><br>Please note that the presentation will be held in English.<br><br>To attend the presentation in person, please register via e-mail to: events@arctic.com<br>To follow the presentation digitally, please register via: https://forms.office.com/r/uCTp6CdJVL<br><br>About 00NATION/Nordavind AS:<br>00 NATION is a gaming and esports organization based on art, fashion, music and internet culture, with talent management, content production, community building and sports performance at its core.<br><br>Disclaimer:<br>This press release is not for release, directly or indirectly, in or into any jurisdiction where such release, publication or distribution is unlawful (except in accordance with applicable laws). The information contained herein does not constitute an offer to sell or the solicitation of an offer to buy nor shall there be any sale of the securities referred to herein in any jurisdiction in which such offer, solicitation or sale would be unlawful prior to the registration, exemption from registration or qualification under the securities laws of any jurisdiction<br><br>Sebastian Geurts<br>CEO, 00NATION<br>T: +47 991 12 321<br>E: sg@00nation.com<br><br>Stein Wilmann<br>COO, 00NATION<br>T: +47 467 45 484<br>E: smw@00nation.com</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>RIVALRY PARTNERS WITH 00 NATION, NEW HIRES/TALENT UPDATE</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2021-09-24 09:03:09</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>RIVALRY/MGNET<br>Through its wholly owned US subsidiary, MGNET LLC, 00 NATION has entered into a two-year sponsorship agreement with the sports betting company Rivalry Services ltd. The sponsorship agreement has a base value in the mid-seven-figures (NOK), which may reach into the high-seven-figures if certain bonus thresholds are met. The agreement targets the South American market through its presence in Counter-Strike: Global Offensive as well as other South American initiatives.<br><br>NEW HIRES/TALENT UPDATE<br>The Company is pleased to announce the following talent signings and hires.<br><br>Rocket League:<br><br>A roster consisting of three merited players from the United Kingdom, with experience from top teams in Europe, has united to create a European powerhouse in Rocket League. The entrance to Rocket League will also see 00 NATION with branded in-game items for sale in the official Rocket League Esports Shop, of which 00 NATION targets a royalty based on net sales. <br><br>00 NATION Rocket League now consists of:<br><br>• Jack Pearton alias FlamE<br>• George Rusiecki alias Breezi<br>• Joseph Hibbert alias Hibbs<br>• Ethan Laughland – Coach<br><br>Hires:<br><br>Tor-Oscar Støvland Wold has joined the company and will primarily be responsible talent management, art and fashion projects. Wold also brings with him a portfolio of talent, including visual artists Trym Ruud and Doodle Twins, both frequently referenced in Norwegian media. Trym Ruud, during his first active yearas an NFT artist, recently eclipsed the NOK 20 million mark in sales, while Doodle Twins, only 14 years of age, are emerging fan favorites and projected future stars.<br><br>Wold and 00 NATION will also enter into a joint venture for Blank Galleri which showcases and developes up and coming talent in the art scene, in addition to 00 NATION assuming full ownership of Wold’s fashion customization store Oslo Custom, to bring fashion and custom products closer to gaming.<br><br>Disclaimer:<br><br>This press release is not for release, directly or indirectly, in or into any jurisdiction where such release, publication or distribution is unlawful (except in accordance with applicable laws). The information contained herein does not constitute an offer to sell or the solicitation of an offer to buy nor shall there be any sale of the securities referred to herein in any jurisdiction in which such offer, solicitation or sale would be unlawful prior to the registration, exemption from registration or qualification under the securities laws of any jurisdiction.<br><br>Contacts:<br><br>Stein Wilmann – COO<br>smw@00nation.com<br><br>Paul Davis - Commercial Director<br>pd@00nation.com</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
