<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Nordavind AS becomes 00Nation, signs top CS:GO team, announces new talent and strengthens organization</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2021-09-03 19:03:40</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Nordavind will as of today change its brand name to 00Nation. The company will utilize the brand 00Nation in all areas of business, including all esports divisions.<br><br>The change of brand name reflects the new and broader scope of business operations where we will build a global community centered around esports and gaming, crossing over with arts, fashion, sports and music.  <br><br><br>00Nation signs top Counter-Strike: Global Offensive roster:<br><br>00Nation has signed one of the most engaging esports teams in the world, the Brazilian Counter-Strike: Global Offensive team, O Plano who, effective immediately will start competing under the 00Nation brand. O Plano consists of multiple CSGO Major finalists, in addition to being led by two-time World Champion Raphael Camargo. The roster has an aggregate social media following of 2.5M highly engaged followers, one of the largest in gaming universe. The team will make their debut in the Blast Nordic Masters 2021 on September 4th.  <br><br><br>00Nation strengthens the organization with top creative resource:<br><br>00Nation is pleased to announce that Christian Aass, founder and former head of TRY Film, has become a part of our management team. Christian has 12 years’ experience from TV productions including seven seasons of 71 grader nord and Paradise Hotel, in addition to wide range of other major productions and household names including, but not limited to, Senkveld, Idol, Farmen etc. Christian has built several startups, most notably Bambuser a software company which specializes in interactive video streaming.<br><br><br>CEO Sebastian Geurts says:<br><br>“We have been working almost a month together, beginning the process of bringing together the art, fashion, music, culture into the gaming brand. We are excited to see new management coming together whilst seeing our talent working together on the joint mission. We are with today’s launch and rebranding, viewing this as the first day of our journey towards putting the Norway back on the global gaming and esports scene.”<br><br><br>Christian Aass says:<br><br>“With 00Nation I see the opportunity to build something truly exceptional, something that has never been done before. Working with the team there we will bring together communities, people and talent who share incredible ambitions, values and vibes on a global level to fulfill the vision”. <br><br><br>About 00Nation/Nordavind:<br><br>00 NATION is a gaming and esports organization based on art, fashion, music and internet culture, with talent management, content production, community building and sports performance at its core.<br><br><br>Disclaimer:<br><br>This press release is not for release, directly or indirectly, in or into any jurisdiction where such release, publication or distribution is unlawful (except in accordance with applicable laws). The information contained herein does not constitute an offer to sell or the solicitation of an offer to buy nor shall there be any sale of the securities referred to herein in any jurisdiction in which such offer, solicitation or sale would be unlawful prior to the registration, exemption from registration or qualification under the securities laws of any jurisdiction.<br><br><br>Contacts:<br><br>Stein Wilmann – COO<br>wilmann@nordavind.gg<br>+4746745484</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
