<td><h2>NVD: Nordavind AS is registered on the NOTC-list</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2021-01-04 17:32:38</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Nordavind AS is registered on the NOTC-list as of 5 January 2021 with ticker code “NVD”. The company has issued 5,116,000 shares each with a par value NOK 0.10, all of which is registered in the VPS with ISIN code NO 001 0915275. Based on the last traded price (equity issue closed on 17 December 2020) the market capitalization is NOK 43,486,000 (NOK 8.50 per share). The company has entered into an agreement whereby it will be able to use the NOTC reporting system as from 5 January 2021.<br><br>Nordavind AS is a multi-vertical media company operating at the esports, gaming and pop culture.<br><br>Please see attached Annual Report 2019</p></td>
</tr>
